    "updated_at": "2019-09-08T19:37:43Z",
    "body": "Why go through the shell? Can't you just ask the operating system for the time through Rust? Even macOS has `gettimeofday(2)` with microsecond precision and certainly millisecond accuracy.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
